This repository contains no third-party data. The setup scripts in scripts/
download the following into data/, where each keeps its own licence:

- Wiktionary-derived dictionary data (via kaikki.org)
  Wiktionary content is CC BY-SA 3.0 / GFDL. Attribution required; the
  share-alike terms follow the data, not this codebase.
  https://kaikki.org  ·  https://www.wiktionary.org

- spaCy (MIT) and its language models, whose licences vary per model
  (commonly MIT or CC BY-SA).  https://spacy.io

- Stanza (Apache 2.0) and Universal Dependencies models.
  https://stanfordnlp.github.io/stanza  ·  https://universaldependencies.org

- CAMeL Tools / Farasa for Arabic morphological analysis — check the licence of
  the specific analyser before shipping anything that depends on it.

Texts you import are yours. LL_textreader is single-instance by design and does not
host or redistribute anyone's reading material.
